## Cross-branch integration: Grok pass 3 + consolidation gate

[PR #26](https://github.com/searadacunha/Dark-MAGA/pull/26) has now been merged into `main` (latest includes README updates, the 316-post X delta, six source documents, offline validator/tests and [current research status](https://github.com/searadacunha/Dark-MAGA/blob/main/docs/RESEARCH_STATUS_2026-11-06.md)). It did **not** touch this PR's branch or the historical replay receipts.

Before merging PR #25, please synchronize your isolated branch with the new main without resetting another worktree. Keep the README title, publication baseline and frozen studies intact. Your financial replay is the most important progress, but **[P0 issue #27](https://github.com/searadacunha/Dark-MAGA/issues/27)** needs explicit disposition:
1. quantify/repair the **22,152 missed SPL Transfer edges** in `trades.parquet`, and test mint-absent transfers and closed accounts;
2. regenerate or distinctly version **all dependent old 19:30:13-bound reports** (`CASE_REPORT`, `EARLY_BUYERS`, `TOP_TRADERS`, downstream generators), with before/after figures;
3. conduct a focused second-person receipt audit of 7GVC's **own** Perpetuals close, 41.197M purchase, direct 20M to 9Sxm, three satellite payments and Noah group counterparty classifications;
4. run **three new Grok tests** using the imported `docs/historical/pass3/` source material: match **9Sxm ~1.8M DMAGA → 17.875 SOL** to a raw swap (15 Jul, timezone unknown); check **6QFD 15.3M / 1.53%** before Noah against ATA slot balances; and compare the **specific BARRON mint's** creator/funding history against DMAGA, stripping services and not equating social overlap with wallet ownership.

The new source archive does not introduce validated chain transfers by itself. No new daily X monitoring. Please update the PR description with the remaining gaps, actual tests executed, and a clean merge recommendation. **Avoid claiming Musk knew, one wallet controller, or one team across tokens without discriminating evidence.**
